@startuml 01-core-data-model
title MOEX DAMS - Core Data Model (LinkML moex-core / registries)
hide empty members
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

note as N_SRC
  Normative source:
  moex-core.yaml, moex-registries.yaml,
  moex-governance.yaml (mixins), moex-types.yaml
  UML shows key slots only.
end note

abstract class ModelElement {
  +element_id : uriorcurie [1]
  +name : string [1]
  +title : string [0..1]
  +description : string [1]
  +aliases : string [0..*]
  +tags : string [0..*]
  +lifecycle_status : LifecycleStatusEnum [1]
}
note right of ModelElement
  Abstract root (moex-core).
  Mixin HasLifecycle on all ModelElement.
  Further mixins (HasOwnership, HasBusinessClassification,
  HasGovernanceClassification, HasPolicyBindings, HasProvenance)
  attach per subclass — not separate Identified/Governed classes.
end note

package "Концептуальный уровень" #FFF2CC {
  class ConceptualEntity {
    +parent_concept_ref : ConceptualEntity [0..1]
    +key_attribute_refs : uriorcurie [0..*]
  }
}

package "Логический уровень" #D9EAD3 {
  class DomainContext {
    +domain_ref : BusinessDomain [1]
    +solution_ref : ITSolution [0..1]
    +namespace : uri [1]
    +business_process_refs : BusinessProcess [0..*]
  }
  class LogicalEntity {
    +context_ref : DomainContext [1]
    +conceptual_entity_refs : ConceptualEntity [0..*]
    +solution_ref : ITSolution [0..1]
    +solution_data_role : SolutionDataRoleEnum [1]
    +identity_rule : string [0..1]
    +business_key_kind : BusinessKeyKindEnum [0..1]
    +key_attribute_refs : uriorcurie [0..*]
    +conceptual_alignment_status : ConceptualAlignmentStatusEnum [0..1]
    +alignment_rationale : string [0..1]
    +isolation_rationale : string [0..1]
  }
  class ConceptualProperty {
    +property_owner_entity_ref : ConceptualEntity [1]
    +significance_basis : SignificanceBasisEnum [1..*]
    +property_kind : PropertyKindEnum [1]
    +conceptual_domain_ref : ConceptualDomain [0..1]
    +is_identifying : boolean [0..1]
    +genesis_kind : GenesisKindEnum [1]
  }
  class LogicalAttribute {
    +owner_entity_ref : LogicalEntity [1]
    +concept_ref : ConceptualProperty [0..1]
    +value_domain_ref : ValueDomain [0..1]
    +data_type_ref : DataType [0..1]
    +critical_data_element : boolean [0..1]
    +logical_type : LogicalDataTypeEnum [0..1] <<deprecated>>
    +required : boolean [1]
    +multivalued : boolean [1]
    +value_set_ref : uri [0..1] <<deprecated>>
    +mapping_coverage_status : MappingCoverageStatusEnum [0..1]
    +mapping_rationale : string [0..1]
  }
  class Relationship {
    +source_entity_ref : uriorcurie [1]
    +target_entity_ref : uriorcurie [1]
    +source_min_cardinality : integer [0..1]
    +source_max_cardinality : integer [0..1]
    +target_min_cardinality : integer [0..1]
    +target_max_cardinality : integer [0..1]
    +identifying : boolean [0..1]
    +associative : boolean [0..1]
    +relationship_kind : RelationshipKindEnum [0..1]
  }
}

package "Технический уровень (TechnicalAsset)" #FCE5CD {
  abstract class TechnicalAsset {
    +asset_namespace : string [1]
    +qualified_name : string [1]
    +system_ref : ITSystem [1]
    +asset_kind : enum [1]
    +technology : string [0..1]
    +direction : FlowDirectionEnum [0..1]
    +solution_ref : ITSolution [0..1]
  }
  class DataCarrier {
    +structure_ref : uri [0..1]
    +mapping_coverage_status : MappingCoverageStatusEnum [0..1]
  }
  class AccessPoint
  class DataContainer
  class ExecutionAsset
  class PhysicalField {
    +carrier_ref : DataCarrier [1]
    +native_name : string [1]
    +native_type : string [1]
    +required : boolean [1]
    +ordinal_position : integer [0..1]
    +schema_path : string [0..1]
  }
}

package "Трассируемость" #EADCF8 {
  class Mapping {
    +source_refs : uriorcurie [1..*]
    +target_refs : uriorcurie [1..*]
    +mapping_type : MappingTypeEnum [1]
    +mapping_cardinality : MappingCardinalityEnum [1]
    +transformation_ref : uri [0..1]
    +transformation_expression : string [0..1]
    +confidence : decimal [0..1]
  }
}

package "Реестры (RegistryEntry)" #F5F5F5 {
  abstract class RegistryEntry {
    +registry_id : uriorcurie [1]
    +registry_name : string [1]
    +master_system : string [1]
    +registry_status : LifecycleStatusEnum [1]
  }
  class ITSystem
  class ITSolution {
    +member_system_refs : ITSystem [0..*]
    +platform_ref : ITPlatform [0..1]
  }
  class GlossaryTerm
  class BusinessDomain
}

ModelElement <|-- ConceptualEntity
ModelElement <|-- ConceptualProperty
ModelElement <|-- DomainContext
ModelElement <|-- LogicalEntity
ModelElement <|-- LogicalAttribute
ModelElement <|-- Relationship
ModelElement <|-- TechnicalAsset
TechnicalAsset <|-- DataCarrier
TechnicalAsset <|-- AccessPoint
TechnicalAsset <|-- DataContainer
TechnicalAsset <|-- ExecutionAsset
ModelElement <|-- PhysicalField
ModelElement <|-- Mapping

RegistryEntry <|-- ITSystem
RegistryEntry <|-- ITSolution
RegistryEntry <|-- GlossaryTerm
RegistryEntry <|-- BusinessDomain

ModelElement "0..*" --> "0..*" GlossaryTerm : glossary_term_refs
DomainContext "0..*" --> "1" BusinessDomain : domain_ref
DomainContext "1" <-- "0..*" LogicalEntity : context_ref
LogicalEntity "1" *-- "0..*" LogicalAttribute : attributes
LogicalEntity "0..*" --> "0..*" ConceptualEntity : conceptual_entity_refs
LogicalEntity "0..*" --> "0..1" ITSolution : solution_ref
ConceptualProperty "0..*" --> "1" ConceptualEntity : property_owner_entity_ref
LogicalAttribute "0..*" --> "0..1" ConceptualProperty : concept_ref
Relationship "0..*" --> "1" ConceptualEntity : source/target\n(via uriorcurie)
Relationship "0..*" --> "1" LogicalEntity : source/target\n(via uriorcurie)

TechnicalAsset "0..*" --> "1" ITSystem : system_ref
TechnicalAsset "0..*" --> "0..1" ITSolution : solution_ref
DataCarrier "1" *-- "0..*" PhysicalField : physical_fields
ITSolution "1" o-- "0..*" ITSystem : member_system_refs

Mapping "0..*" ..> ModelElement : source_refs / target_refs\n(uriorcurie 1..*)

note bottom of Mapping
  One canonical Mapping class.
  mapping_type: realizes, entity_physical,
  field_mapping, aligns_with, derivation, …
  No ModelElementRealization / Transformation classes.
end note
note bottom of ConceptualEntity
  No ConceptualAttribute class.
  Key props via key_attribute_refs only.
end note
note bottom of TechnicalAsset
  Collections: data_carriers, access_points,
  data_containers, execution_assets (ADR-031).
  Identity: asset_namespace + qualified_name.
end note
note bottom of LogicalAttribute
  value_set_ref is uri, not a ValueSet class.
end note
@enduml
